+msgid "How colour is upscaled when a video is shown through the compatibility renderer. Gaussian matches Dolby Vision hardware players most closely. Lanczos is slightly sharper at colour edges but further from Dolby hardware. Videos shown by the native Dolby Vision engine are not affected. Applies to the next video."
